#: processes/copy-out-materialized.bpmn:105
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Into the copier's own declared `folio/`, never a scratch area — a directory nobody declared is a directory nobody gates, and the copy would be publishable by accident. The copy is NOT read-only: it is the copier's own content, makes no claim about anybody else's bytes, and freezing it too would mean the next person needs a copy of the copy."
msgstr ""

